<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>FlexiRule Documentation</title><link>https://sendipad.github.io/flexirule-docs/</link><description>Recent content on FlexiRule Documentation</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 01 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://sendipad.github.io/flexirule-docs/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Installation</title><link>https://sendipad.github.io/flexirule-docs/docs/installation/</link><pubDate>Thu, 01 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://sendipad.github.io/flexirule-docs/docs/installation/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="installation"&gt;Installation&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To get started with FlexiRule, you can install it via our package manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="prerequisites"&gt;Prerequisites&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Go 1.21+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Node.js 18+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="quick-start"&gt;Quick Start&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;curl -sSL https://flexirule.com/install.sh | sh
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Creating a Rule</title><link>https://sendipad.github.io/flexirule-docs/docs/creating-a-rule/</link><pubDate>Thu, 01 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://sendipad.github.io/flexirule-docs/docs/creating-a-rule/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="creating-a-rule"&gt;Creating a Rule&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rules are the core of FlexiRule. Here is how you create one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="simple-rule-example"&gt;Simple Rule Example&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define a rule in a &lt;code&gt;.fr&lt;/code&gt; file:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code class="language-flexirule" data-lang="flexirule"&gt;rule &amp;#34;Discount&amp;#34;
 when
 customer.total &amp;gt; 100
 then
 customer.applyDiscount(0.1)
end
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h2 id="explanation"&gt;Explanation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The rule above checks if a customer&amp;rsquo;s total is greater than 100 and applies a 10% discount.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Configuration</title><link>https://sendipad.github.io/flexirule-docs/docs/configuration/</link><pubDate>Thu, 01 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://sendipad.github.io/flexirule-docs/docs/configuration/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="configuration"&gt;Configuration&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Configure your FlexiRule instance using the &lt;code&gt;config.yaml&lt;/code&gt; file.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;server&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;port&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;8080&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;engine&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;threads&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;cache&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>API Usage</title><link>https://sendipad.github.io/flexirule-docs/docs/api-usage/</link><pubDate>Thu, 01 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://sendipad.github.io/flexirule-docs/docs/api-usage/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="api-usage"&gt;API Usage&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FlexiRule provides a robust REST API for evaluating rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="evaluate-endpoint"&gt;Evaluate Endpoint&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;POST /api/v1/evaluate&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="request-body"&gt;Request Body&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-json" data-lang="json"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;{
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;#34;rule&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Discount&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;#34;data&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;#34;customer&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;#34;total&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;150&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>